# USE WHEN interpreting scanning results, analyzing validation reports, or troubleshooting scanning outputs

# Scanning Output Reference

## Overview
This reference document provides examples of scanning automation output formats and how to interpret them. It serves as a guide to understanding the reports generated by the scanning automation system.

## Output Format Structure

Scanning output follows a consistent structure:

```
=== Automated Scanning Report ===
Date: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS

1. [Issue Category 1]: [Count] issues found
   - [File Path] (line [Number]): [Issue Description]
   - [File Path] (line [Number]): [Issue Description]

2. [Issue Category 2]: [Count] issues found
   - [File Path] (line [Number]): [Issue Description]
   - [File Path] (line [Number]): [Issue Description]

Recommended Actions:
- [Action 1]
- [Action 2]
```

